Stage 2 of 8: Gear Up and Learn to Fight, levels 1 to 5

Erga's newbie store (from the Center of Town: four west, one south)
hands out free equipment fit for anyone under level 5; the donation
room (five north, one east) has castoffs from veterans. Wear and wield
everything, then practice on the newbie farm.

Death carries no penalty at level 5 and under, so take risks now and
learn kill, assess, and wimpy. Ask questions freely on the newbie
channel; everyone started here.

Choose your corpse automation: "set autogold on" takes coins only,
while "set autoloot on" takes coins and every gettable item, making
autogold redundant and filling your inventory faster.

"set autokill on" does not attack by itself; it only makes a manually
entered bare "kill" choose the first visible NPC. Keep naming targets
until you are comfortable. "set wimpy 25" retreats below 25 percent HP
when an escape is possible. Screenreader mode already condenses combat
into short summaries, so the combatbrief display switches are not needed.

